 {
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Release notes &mdash; Example</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/s.css\">\n  <style>body { color: red; } a > b { }</style>\n  <script>window.x = \"<p>not html</p>\"; if (a < b && c > d) {}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <nav aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> | <a href=\"/docs\">Docs</a></nav>\n  <header><h1 class=\"title\">Release&nbsp;2.0</h1><p class=\"lead\">The <em>fastest</em> release yet.</p></header>\n  <main>\n    <article>\n      <h2 id=\"new\">What's new</h2>\n      <p>We rewrote the <code>parser</code> and the <a href=\"https://example.com/docs/parser (v2)\" title=\"Parser &quot;docs&quot;\">parser docs</a>.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Faster <strong>startup</strong></li>\n        <li>Smaller binaries\n          <ol start=\"3\"><li>Linux</li><li value=\"10\">macOS</li><li>Windows</li></ol>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <blockquote><p>It just works.</p><footer>&mdash; A user</footer></blockquote>\n      <figure><img src=\"/img/chart 1.png\" alt=\"Chart [beta]\" title=\"Speed\"><figcaption>Speed over time</figcaption></figure>\n      <h3>Upgrade</h3>\n      <pre><code class=\"lang-shell\">$ npm install example@2\n$ example --version\n2.0.0</code></pre>\n      <table>\n        <caption>Supported platforms</caption>\n        <thead><tr><th>OS</th><th>Arch</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody><tr><td>Linux</td><td>x64 | arm64</td></tr><tr><td>macOS</td><td>arm64</td></tr></tbody>\n      </table>\n      <details><summary>Changelog</summary><p>Hidden details</p></details>\n      <details open><summary>Known issues</summary><ul><li>None</li></ul></details>\n      <dl><dt>API</dt><dd>Stable</dd><dt>CLI</dt><dd>Beta</dd></dl>\n      <hr>\n      <p>Questions? <a href=\"mailto:team@example.com\">Email us</a><br>or open an issue.</p>\n    </article>\n    <aside hidden><p>Ad</p></aside>\n  </main>\n  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 Example &amp; Co.</p></footer>\n  <noscript><p>Enable JS</p></noscript>\n  <template><p>tpl</p></template>\n  <iframe src=\"x\"></iframe>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "markdown": "# Release 2\\.0\n\nThe *fastest* release yet.\n\n## What's new\n\nWe rewrote the `parser` and the [parser docs](https://example.com/docs/parser%20\\(v2\\) \"Parser \\\"docs\\\"\").\n\n- Faster **startup**\n\n- Smaller binaries\n\n  3. Linux\n\n  10. macOS\n\n  11. Windows\n\n> It just works.\n\n> — A user\n\n![Chart [beta\\]](/img/chart%201.png \"Speed\")\n\nSpeed over time\n\n### Upgrade\n\n```shell\n$ npm install example@2\n$ example --version\n2.0.0\n```\n\nSupported platforms\n\n| OS | Arch |\n| --- | --- |\n| Linux | x64 \\| arm64 |\n| macOS | arm64 |\n\nChangelog\n\nKnown issues\n\n- None\n\n**API**\n: Stable\n\n**CLI**\n: Beta\n\n---\n\nQuestions? [Email us](mailto:team@example.com)  \nor open an issue.\n\n© 2026 Example & Co.",
  "text": "Release notes — Example\n  \n  \n  \n\n\n  Home | Docs\n  Release 2.0The fastest release yet.\n  \n    \n      What's new\n      We rewrote the parser and the parser docs.\n      \n        Faster startup\n        Smaller binaries\n          LinuxmacOSWindows\n        \n      \n      It just works.— A user\n      Speed over time\n      Upgrade\n      $ npm install example@2\n$ example --version\n2.0.0\n      \n        Supported platforms\n        OSArch\n        Linuxx64 | arm64macOSarm64\n      \n      ChangelogHidden details\n      Known issuesNone\n      APIStableCLIBeta\n      \n      Questions? Email usor open an issue.\n    \n    Ad\n  \n  © 2026 Example & Co.\n  \n  tpl"
